(Bastiat undertakes to demonstrate the harmony of the Economic) Tj T*
(laws,?that is to say, their tendency towards a common design,) Tj T*
(which is the progressive improvement of the human race. He proves) Tj T*
(convincingly that individual interests, taken in the aggregate, far) Tj T*
(from being antagonistic, aid each other mutually; and that, so far is) Tj T*
