(another, each individual, each family, each country has an interest) Tj T*
(in the prosperity of all others. He shows that, between agriculturist) Tj T*
(and manufacturer, capitalist and labourer, producer and consumer,) Tj T*
(native and foreigner, there is in reality no antagonism, but, on) Tj T*
(the contrary, a community of interest; and that, in order that the) Tj T*
(natural Economic laws should act constantly so as to produce this) Tj T*
(result, one thing alone is necessary?namely, respect for Liberty and) Tj T*
(Property. His design is best explained in his own words: ?I undertake) Tj T*
(in this work,? he says, ?to demonstrate the Harmony of those laws) Tj T*
(of Providence which govern human society. What makes these laws) Tj T*
(harmonious and not discordant is, that all principles, all motives,) Tj T*
(all springs of action, all interests, co-operate towards a grand) Tj T*
(final result, which humanity will never reach by reason of its native) Tj T*
(?imperfection?, [p029] but to which it will always approximate more) Tj T*
(and more by reason of its unlimited ?capability of improvement?. And) Tj T*
(that result is, the indefinite approximation of all classes towards a) Tj T*
(level, which is always rising; in other words, the ?equalization? of) Tj T*
(individuals in the general ?amelioration?.?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
