(possible value on his services. But gradually, by the operation of) Tj T*
(Competition, this value tends to become proportioned to the labour) Tj T*
(performed; so that the evolution is brought to a conclusion when) Tj T*
(equal labour is exchanged for equal labour, both serving as the) Tj T*
(vehicle of an ever-increasing amount of gratuitous utility, to the) Tj T*
