( Political Economy, in the sense in which we use that term, than) Tj T*
( Navigation forms part of the science of Astronomy. The principles) Tj T*
( supplied by Political Economy are indeed necessary elements) Tj T*
( in their solution, but they are not the only or even the most) Tj T*
( important elements. The writer who pursues such investigations is,) Tj T*
( in fact, engaged on the great science of Legislation; a science) Tj T*
( which requires a knowledge of the general principles supplied by) Tj T*
( Political Economy, but differs from it essentially in its subject,) Tj T*
( its premises, and its conclusions. The subject of legislation is not) Tj T*
( wealth, but human welfare. Its premises are drawn from an infinite) Tj T*
( variety of phenomena, supported by evidence of every degree of) Tj T*
( strength, and authorizing conclusions deserving every degree of) Tj T*
( assent, from perfect confidence to bare suspicion. And its expounder) Tj T*
( is enabled, and even required, not merely to state certain general) Tj T*
( facts, but to urge the adoption or rejection of actual measures or) Tj T*
( trains of action.) Tj T*
