( those causes. The business of a Political Economist is neither to) Tj T*
( recommend nor to dissuade, but to state general principles which it) Tj T*
( is fatal to neglect, but neither advisable nor perhaps practicable) Tj T*
( to use as the sole, or even the principal, guides in the actual) Tj T*
( conduct of affairs. In the meantime, the duty of each individual) Tj T*
( writer is clear. Employed as he is upon a science in which error,) Tj T*
( or even ignorance, may be productive of such intense and such) Tj T*
( extensive mischief, he is bound, like a juryman, to give deliverance) Tj T*
( true according to the evidence, and to allow neither sympathy with) Tj T*
( indigence nor disgust at profusion or at avarice, neither reverence) Tj T*
( for existing institutions nor detestation of existing abuses?neither) Tj T*
( love of popularity nor of paradox, nor of system, to deter him from) Tj T*
( stating what he believes to be the facts, or from drawing from those) Tj T*
